            <div xml:id="d931">

                <pb facs="0835" n="719" sameAs="frus:frus1915/pg719"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 812.00/15314.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Confidential Agent of the Provisional Government of
                        Mexico to the Secretary of State</hi>.</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1915-06-26">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">June 26, 1915</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Excellency</hi>: Pursuant to instructions just
                    received from General Villa, I have the honor to inform your excellency that
                    General Roque Gonzalez Garza, having resigned as President of the Sovereign
                    Convention charged with the federal Executive Power, Mr. Francisco Lagos
                    Cházaro, has been designated by the Convention as his successor.</p>
                <p>Please accept [etc.]</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Enrique C. Llorente.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
